  "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Diamond Bvlgarvia is envisioned as a contemporary high-rise residential development integrating living spaces, retail, and amenities into a cohesive whole. The project aims to establish a progressive residential community with a high-quality living environment that balances urban convenience, green landscapes, and commercial potential. With people at its core, the development is designed to deliver a contemporary living experience through a diverse range of amenities, open spaces, and convenient connectivity, helping create a new architectural landmark in the Bắc S&ocirc;ng Cấm urban area.</p>"
